{"id":"wb-6-784","name":"榆林卫城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"榆林卫城","text":"榆林卫城位于中国陕西省榆林市，已列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n1992年4月20日，榆林城墙公布为第三批陕西省文物保护单位，编号3-1-51。\n\n2006年5月25日，榆林卫城公布为第六批全国重点文物保护单位","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E5%8D%AB%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":85987613,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85987613","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/64704f17d1bdbe2205ad4828.jpg","title":"榆林古城.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/%E6%A6%86%E6%9E%97%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"申威隆","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​依次可见“六楼骑街”及远处的镇北台","width":320,"height":240},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}